Short:        UHC tools for UP-Term
Author:       Patrik (UHC)
Uploader:     spotup@gmail.com (spotUP)
Type:         util/misc
Version:      @VERSION@
Architecture: m68k-amigaos >= 3.0.0
Requires:     comm/term/up-term.lha >= @NEEDSBASE@
Distribution: Aminet

The UHC tools (aget, UHCSearch and the get and search scripts). This package holds no UHC files: Install
downloads uhctools_os3.lha from uhc.megaburken.net and installs it in SYS:UHC (a UHC install already there is used as it is). Needs a network connection.

Needs the base archive up-term.lha (version @NEEDSBASE@ or newer) installed first.

Install: unpack, double-click Install. Uninstall removes what this archive installed.
